  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:45:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. I'm calling about a trash pickup. Or a missed one, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Let me grab some info. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:45:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "178 Eustis Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:45:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "178 Eustis. Got it. And what got missed, the regular trash or recycling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:45:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's bulk stuff. The landlord left it out after a tenant moved out. Couch, a mattress, some boxes, a few bags. It's been sitting at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:46:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a landlord left bulk waste at the curb after a move-out. And did it go out for this week's pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It went out last week and this week. They skipped it both times. So that's the second miss in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:46:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha, second miss. [pause] Sorry, I'm just typing that in. Did it have any kind of tag or sticker on it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, I'm on speaker, my phone case has a loose popsocket and it rattles on the table. Let me pick this up. [pause] Okay. I don't see a sticker on it. I can walk out and look closer if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, I'll note no tag visible. Bulk items sometimes need to be scheduled ahead, so that may be part of it, but I'll put this in as a missed pickup request and have the crew supervisor look at it. Is the pile right at the curb, not in the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the curb, in front of the house. Nothing in the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Let me read it back. 178 Eustis Avenue, bulk waste left by the landlord after a move-out, out two weeks running, nothing tagged, at the curb. Sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's sorted out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "0164, perfect. Someone should be in touch early next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
